 "text": "-->\nVETERANS OFFICE | perkinscounty\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nHOME\nDEPARTMENTS\nDRIVER LICENSES\nCLERK OF COURTS\nDIRECTOR OF EQUALIZATION\nFINANCE OFFICE (Auditor/Treasurer)\nTAX DEEDS\nHIGHWAY\nREGISTER OF DEEDS\nSHERIFF/EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT\nSTATES ATTORNEY\nVETERANS OFFICE\nWEED AND PEST\nPREDATOR CONTROL\n4-H\nCOMMISSIONERS\n2026 Meeting Minutes\nLEGAL NOTICES\nGIS & PLAT MAP\nORGANIZED TOWNSHIP PORTAL\nELECTIONS\nPROPERTY TAX RELIEF PROGRAMS\nARCHIVE LEGAL NOTICES\nABOUT US\nJOB OPPORTUNITIES\nMORE PORTALS\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nThe Board of County Commissioner in each county appoints a Veteran Service Officer to assists veterans and their families in accessing benefits available through the United States Veterans Administration. Perkins County currently does NOT offer a bus service to Fort Meade, South Dakota, for medical visits for veterans. However, you can set up transportation through this link: http://www.va.gov/healthbenefits/vtp/highly_rural_transportation_grants.asp\nVeterans Service Officer\nHours of Operation: Monday-Thursday: 7:30-5:00\nFriday: 7:30-12:00\nIn the Finance Office\n~ CLOSED ON HOLIDAYS ~\nBison Office\nPO Box 126\nBison, SD 57620\n605-244-7299 (Phone)\n605-231-5560 (Fax)\n605-244-5613 (Finance Office Phone)\nBridget Keller - Veterans Service Officer\nCell # 701-471-8453\nbottom of page",
